  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Alma2 seeks to pull down pride and contention among his people by preaching word, Alma 4:19. let us repent, that we provoke not the Lord to pull down his wrath, Alma 12:37. Moroni1 pulls down pride of king-men, Alma 51:17–18. Ammoron will pull down wrath of God to his utter destruction, Alma 54:9. Moroni1 seeks not for power, but to pull it down, Alma 60:36. wilt thou say to brother, Let me pull mote from thine eye, 3 Ne. 14:4 (Matt. 7:4).",
